    "raw": "\\*Data estimated. \nPhase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 13.811 + 0.058 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.017 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ $H^{0} - H_{298}^{0} = 13.811 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.029 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 1.017 \\times 10^{2} T^{-1} - 4.461$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-1633 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -12.510 - 0.590 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.238 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 25.500 T^{-1}$ $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -12.510 + 0.590 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T + 1.238 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 12.750 T^{-1} - 9.910 \\times 10^{-3} T$ 1633-2000 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -15.758 + 1.659 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.709 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} - 20.100 T^{-1}$ $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -15.758 - 1.659 \\times 10^{-3} T \\ln T + 1.709 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} - 10.050 T^{-1} + 7.957 \\times 10^{-3} T$ \nSource: Data are those estimated by Gronvold (47). ",
